# The generated ledger, dispute table, cached forensic features and the demo evidence
# subset ARE tracked, so a fresh clone runs without regenerating anything (~14 MB).
# Excluded: the full 123 MB training corpus, which is reproducible from seed 20260822 via
# `python -m scripts.make_receipts 3000`.
data/evidence/
data/evidence_scored.parquet

# RAW DOWNLOADED DATASETS -- never commit these.
# data/real holds the IEEE-CIS source CSVs (train_transaction.csv alone is 651 MB) and the
# CORD/SROIE arrow shards: 3.9 GB in total. data/evidence_real holds 2,400 full-resolution
# receipt photographs, 688 MB. GitHub hard-rejects any single file over 100 MB, and none of
# it belongs in version control anyway -- every byte is re-downloadable from Hugging Face by
# scripts/, and the derived parquet files that the app actually reads ARE committed.
data/real/
data/evidence_real/
data/evidence_real_features.parquet
data/_adv_tmp/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
web/dist/
.gcp
.venv/
.DS_Store

# Local editor and tooling directories
.vscode/
.idea/
.cursor/
.assistant/
